Package: ai2analytics
Type: Package
Title: AI-Powered Last-Mile Analytics Framework for Pharmaceutical Commercial Operations
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R: person("AI2Analytics", "Contributors", email = "noreply@example.com",
                   role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Native R port of the AI2Analytics Python framework. Provides
    reusable pipeline templates for entity segmentation and market mix
    modelling, plus a JSONL-backed knowledge store for accumulating
    decisions across runs. Each pipeline separates logic from data shape
    so the same template handles different brands, regions, and schemas
    via configuration.
